{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "36efdb88a79c1559a0f18cf03096f7426ed6522dde74ba9a0b73301ee7a90bc2",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0001",
      "text": "Fee-on-Transfer Tokens Cause Accounting Mismatch in `creatorBalance` System, Leading to Contract Insolvency and Loss of User Funds",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 130,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0002",
      "text": "### Finding Description and Impact",
      "start": 132,
      "end": 166,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0003",
      "text": "#### Background: Fee-on-Transfer Tokens",
      "start": 168,
      "end": 207,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0004",
      "text": "Fee-on-transfer (FoT) tokens automatically deduct a percentage during every transfer. When you call `transfer(recipient, 100)`, the recipient receives less than 100 tokens because a fee is taken. Common examples:",
      "start": 209,
      "end": 421,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0005",
      "text": "| Token | Fee |",
      "start": 423,
      "end": 438,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0006",
      "text": "|-------|-----|",
      "start": 439,
      "end": 454,
      "line": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0007",
      "text": "| PAXG (Paxos Gold) | 0.02% |",
      "start": 455,
      "end": 484,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0008",
      "text": "| STA (Statera) | 1% |",
      "start": 485,
      "end": 507,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0009",
      "text": "| USDT (configurable) | Up to 0.1% |",
      "start": 508,
      "end": 544,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0010",
      "text": "| Various deflationary tokens | 1-10% |",
      "start": 545,
      "end": 584,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0011",
      "text": "#### Root Cause Analysis",
      "start": 586,
      "end": 610,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0012",
      "text": "The `increaseTokenBalance()` function assumes that the amount requested equals the amount received:",
      "start": 612,
      "end": 711,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0013",
      "text": "The problem:",
      "start": 714,
      "end": 726,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0014",
      "text": "1. User calls `increaseTokenBalance(user, FOT_TOKEN, 1000)`",
      "start": 727,
      "end": 786,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0015",
      "text": "2. `safeTransferFrom` transfers 1000 tokens, but FoT takes 1% fee",
      "start": 787,
      "end": 852,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0016",
      "text": "3. Contract actually receives 990 tokens",
      "start": 853,
      "end": 893,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0017",
      "text": "4. `creatorBalance[user][FOT_TOKEN]` is credited with 1000 (not 990!)",
      "start": 894,
      "end": 963,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0018",
      "text": "This creates an ever-growing deficit between recorded balances and actual token holdings.",
      "start": 965,
      "end": 1054,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0019",
      "text": "#### The Insolvency Math",
      "start": 1056,
      "end": 1080,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0020",
      "text": "Let's trace through with a 1% fee token:",
      "start": 1082,
      "end": 1122,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0021",
      "text": "**Deposit Phase:**",
      "start": 1124,
      "end": 1142,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0022",
      "text": "**Withdrawal Phase:**",
      "start": 1144,
      "end": 1165,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0023",
      "text": "Charlie is the victim. He deposited legitimately but cannot withdraw because earlier users took more than their fair share of the actual tokens.",
      "start": 1167,
      "end": 1311,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0024",
      "text": "#### Impact Assessment",
      "start": 1313,
      "end": 1335,
      "line": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0025",
      "text": "**Severity: HIGH** - Guaranteed fund loss for some users",
      "start": 1337,
      "end": 1393,
      "line": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0026",
      "text": "**1. Guaranteed Insolvency:**",
      "start": 1395,
      "end": 1424,
      "line": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0027",
      "text": "With $n$ users each depositing amount $A$ with fee rate $f$:",
      "start": 1425,
      "end": 1485,
      "line": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0028",
      "text": "- Total recorded: $n \\times A$",
      "start": 1486,
      "end": 1516,
      "line": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0029",
      "text": "- Actual received: $n \\times A \\times (1-f)$",
      "start": 1517,
      "end": 1561,
      "line": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0030",
      "text": "- Deficit: $n \\times A \\times f$",
      "start": 1562,
      "end": 1594,
      "line": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0031",
      "text": "For 100 users depositing 1000 tokens each with 1% fee:",
      "start": 1596,
      "end": 1650,
      "line": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0032",
      "text": "- Recorded: 100,000 tokens",
      "start": 1651,
      "end": 1677,
      "line": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0033",
      "text": "- Actual: 99,000 tokens",
      "start": 1678,
      "end": 1701,
      "line": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0034",
      "text": "- Deficit: 1,000 tokens",
      "start": 1702,
      "end": 1725,
      "line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0035",
      "text": "**2. Last-User-Loses:**",
      "start": 1727,
      "end": 1750,
      "line": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0036",
      "text": "The deficit isn't distributed fairly. Whoever withdraws last bears the entire accumulated loss. This creates a \"bank run\" incentive where users race to withdraw before others.",
      "start": 1751,
      "end": 1926,
      "line": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0037",
      "text": "**3. Silent Accounting Corruption:**",
      "start": 1928,
      "end": 1964,
      "line": 57
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0038",
      "text": "No errors occur during deposits. The `creatorBalance` mapping looks correct. Users have no indication of the problem until mass withdrawals begin.",
      "start": 1965,
      "end": 2111,
      "line": 58
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0039",
      "text": "**4. Compounding Effect:**",
      "start": 2113,
      "end": 2139,
      "line": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0040",
      "text": "Each deposit increases the deficit. More users = larger gap = more severe loss for late withdrawers.",
      "start": 2140,
      "end": 2240,
      "line": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0041",
      "text": "**5. Campaign Creation Impact:**",
      "start": 2242,
      "end": 2274,
      "line": 63
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0042",
      "text": "The same issue exists in `_pullTokens()` for campaign creation. Campaigns may be underfunded, meaning the distributor receives fewer tokens than recorded, causing later claimers to lose out.",
      "start": 2275,
      "end": 2465,
      "line": 64
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0043",
      "text": "#### Affected Token Examples",
      "start": 2467,
      "end": 2495,
      "line": 66
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0044",
      "text": "This vulnerability affects any FoT token that gets whitelisted. Real-world tokens include:",
      "start": 2497,
      "end": 2587,
      "line": 68
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0045",
      "text": "- **PAXG**: Gold-backed token with transfer fees",
      "start": 2588,
      "end": 2636,
      "line": 69
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0046",
      "text": "- **Deflationary tokens**: Many DeFi tokens burn on transfer",
      "start": 2637,
      "end": 2697,
      "line": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0047",
      "text": "- **Reflection tokens**: SafeMoon clones that redistribute fees",
      "start": 2698,
      "end": 2761,
      "line": 71
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0048",
      "text": "If governance whitelists any such token without awareness of this bug, users will lose funds.",
      "start": 2763,
      "end": 2856,
      "line": 73
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0049",
      "text": "### Recommended Mitigation Steps",
      "start": 2858,
      "end": 2890,
      "line": 75
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0050",
      "text": "#### Option 1: Measure Actual Receipt (Recommended)",
      "start": 2892,
      "end": 2943,
      "line": 77
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0051",
      "text": "Modify `increaseTokenBalance()` to credit only what was actually received:",
      "start": 2945,
      "end": 3019,
      "line": 79
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0052",
      "text": "Apply the same pattern to `_pullTokens()`:",
      "start": 3022,
      "end": 3064,
      "line": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0053",
      "text": "#### Option 2: Reject FoT Tokens",
      "start": 3067,
      "end": 3099,
      "line": 85
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0054",
      "text": "If supporting FoT tokens is not desired, explicitly reject them:",
      "start": 3101,
      "end": 3165,
      "line": 87
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0055",
      "text": "#### Option 3: Governance Warning",
      "start": 3168,
      "end": 3201,
      "line": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0056",
      "text": "At minimum, add documentation and governance procedures:",
      "start": 3203,
      "end": 3259,
      "line": 92
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0057",
      "text": "- Clearly document that FoT tokens are not supported",
      "start": 3260,
      "end": 3312,
      "line": 93
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0058",
      "text": "- Add validation in `setRewardTokenMinAmounts()` to verify token behavior before whitelisting",
      "start": 3313,
      "end": 3406,
      "line": 94
    },
    {
      "id": "e_36efdb88a79c_0059",
      "text": "- Emit warnings when tokens with non-standard behavior are detected",
      "start": 3407,
      "end": 3474,
      "line": 95
    }
  ]
}
